  "releaseNotes": "v2.1.0: BREAKING: Removed SupportsRestore property from IWorkflowOperation and IWorkflow interfaces. Compensation now always attempts RestoreAsync (no-op default). Added optional restoreAction on WorkflowBuilder.AddOperation. Added FoundryPropertyKeys constants. Sealed EventArgs and Exception classes. Fixed event handler memory leaks, dispose race conditions, PersistenceMiddleware O(n²) indexing, and thread safety issues. Added CI/CD pipeline and cross-platform publish script.",
